Mount point for secrets the app reads from disk, not the environment.

docker-compose.yml bind-mounts this directory read-only at /run/secrets/abj.
On the server, the Google service-account key for the shop-rental sync lives
here as google-sheets.json. Nothing in here is ever committed — see
.gitignore — and the directory is kept only so the mount works on a fresh
checkout with no Google setup.
